Raanjhana Guitar Chords with strumming pattern sang by Arijit Singh.

Strumming Pattern: DDU UDU

[G#]Kaise ye beete din,        [C#]Rab jaane [D#]dil jaane
[G#]Tera [C#]tarana teri [C#]dhun,        [G#]Milke gale teri [C#]yaadon ke [D#]saye se
[G#]Dil ka [C#]lagaana tha [D#]shagun,        Tere [Fm]sadke [C#]meri [D#]saari zindagi

[G#]Raanjhana, O [G#]Raanjhana,        [G#]Ve Raanjhana [D#]mere yaar ve
[Fm]Raanjhana, O [Fm]Raanjhana,        [Fm]Ve Raanjhana [D#]mere yaar

[G#]Raanjhana O [G#]Raanjhana,        [G#]Ve Raanjhana [D#]mere yaar ve
[Fm]Raanjhana ve, [Fm]Raanjhana ve [D#]Raanjhana!

[G#]Kyun meri aahaton se [D#]parda,        [G#]Kyun meri chahaton se [D#]parda
[C#]Kisi se pyaar [D#]karna hai [G#]manaa

[G#]Raanjhana, O [G#]Raanjhana,        [G#]Ve Raanjhana [D#]mere yaar ve
[Fm]Raanjhana, O [Fm]Raanjhana,        [Fm]Ve Raanjhana [D#]mere yaar

[G#]Simti hawaaon mein [C#]teri [D#]tasveerein,        [G#]Betaabiyon ko [D#]badhaati [D#]hai

[G#] [G#] [C#] [D#],        [G#] [C#] [D#] [D#]

[G#]Sooni nigaahon ko [C#]rang mil [D#]jaaye,        [G#]Aankhon mein [C#]koi [D#]khaab sajaaye
[D#]Kya ye [Fm]khaab sajaana [C#]hai [D#]manaa

[G#]Raanjhana, O [G#]Raanjhana,        [G#]Ve Raanjhana [D#]mere yaar ve
[Fm]Raanjhana, O [Fm]Raanjhana,        [Fm]Ve Raanjhana [D#]mere yaar

[G#]Raanjhana O [G#]Raanjhana,        [G#]Ve Raanjhana [D#]mere yaar ve
